WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:32.860 --> 01:34.030
I'm hooome!

01:34.830 --> 01:37.430
Duke? Duke!

01:41.810 --> 01:45.070
Where'd he go? He was supposed
to be watching the house.

01:51.120 --> 01:52.280
Snow?

02:03.170 --> 02:06.260
What's this cherry tree doing here?

02:09.050 --> 02:10.780
What a pretty black ribbon.

02:11.640 --> 02:12.780
Is this a present?

02:15.500 --> 02:16.810
Chocolat, Chocolat!

02:19.810 --> 02:23.790
We're envoys from the Night of Walpurgis
Executive Committee.

02:24.360 --> 02:25.790
The Night of Walpurgis?

02:26.150 --> 02:29.740
April 30th is known as the
Night of Walpurgis.

02:29.740 --> 02:34.300
There'll be a party for all the
mages in the Human World.

02:34.700 --> 02:37.950
Chocolat, this year the Night
of Walpurgis will feature...

02:37.950 --> 02:41.540
the Debut of the Queen Candidates
in the Human World.

02:42.170 --> 02:45.710
So, I can meet other mages?

02:45.710 --> 02:46.800
Awesome!

02:50.970 --> 02:54.970
We will now cast a spell to allow you
access to Blocken Mountain.

02:54.970 --> 02:59.020
A barrier will prevent any uninvited guests from entering.

03:01.190 --> 03:04.270
You can have your Chevaliers
escort you to the party.

03:04.270 --> 03:07.030
If you use the
Magic Powder in this bottle,

03:07.030 --> 03:11.070
Your Chevaliers will be able to enter as well.

03:13.450 --> 03:15.530
We'll be waiting for you!

03:19.330 --> 03:21.120
The Night of Walpurgis...

03:21.120 --> 03:23.330
sounds like a fun time!

03:25.920 --> 03:29.310
Invitation to the Night of Walpurgis.

03:29.710 --> 03:31.310
The Night of Walpurgis?

03:31.800 --> 03:35.260
Yep. I'm supposed to be escorted,

03:35.260 --> 03:36.930
so you guys are coming too.

03:36.930 --> 03:38.810
Wow, a real escort mission.

03:40.520 --> 03:44.280
I'm really looking forward to meeting all the mages that'll be there!

03:44.770 --> 03:48.790
All of the best mages in the Human
World will be attending.

03:49.320 --> 03:51.190
So make sure
you don't offend them.

03:51.190 --> 03:54.030
Duke, do you want to come too?

03:54.030 --> 03:55.240
No thanks, I'm good.

03:55.240 --> 03:57.450
I've got a date with Keromi-chan,

03:57.450 --> 03:59.800
so you kids go
have fun on your own.

03:59.800 --> 04:00.490
I see.

04:01.660 --> 04:04.750
But wouldn't this "Queen Candidate
Debut" also include Vanilla?

04:04.750 --> 04:05.370
Saule...

04:06.210 --> 04:07.880
Sorry, Chocolat.

04:07.880 --> 04:12.170
Don't worry. It'll be a huge party
with tons of mages there.

04:12.170 --> 04:14.060
There's no way the Ogres could
get away with anything.

04:14.510 --> 04:17.470
Ya got that right! And you're going
to that party to show them...

04:17.470 --> 04:19.780
that you're a respectable Queen Candidate
who won't let them down!

04:20.100 --> 04:23.450
It's all good! I'm 110% prepared!

04:24.350 --> 04:27.730
Mobile Manicure – I've wanted one forever.

04:28.480 --> 04:32.220
Eating these Dance Bonbons will
make you want to dance.

04:32.490 --> 04:37.220
And even the hardest substance will turn into mush with this Puru-Puru Oil.

04:37.660 --> 04:40.280
Why the heck did you buy all this stuff?

04:40.280 --> 04:43.720
All the best mages in the Human
World will be there, right?

04:44.250 --> 04:48.140
Next to them, I'm nobody if I can't increase my magic level.

04:48.790 --> 04:50.850
I don't think it works that way.

04:51.590 --> 04:57.090
"Changes any liquid to a flavorful
drink – Everything Juice."

04:57.720 --> 05:01.320
"They'll make you invisible –
Transparent Crystals."

05:01.720 --> 05:05.100
I went on a splurge and bought
everything I wanted!

05:05.100 --> 05:08.070
There's no helping you if you keep
up this wasteful spending!

05:08.520 --> 05:10.580
Chocolat, we should test something out.

05:10.980 --> 05:13.230
Okay! How about this one?

05:15.110 --> 05:16.830
HOUX-SAMA!!!!!!

05:18.040 --> 05:20.840
Houx-sama, Houx-sama, Houx-sama...!

05:21.240 --> 05:22.950
Waffle-sama!

05:22.950 --> 05:24.800
Please wait for me!

05:25.160 --> 05:29.080
Houx-sama, weren't you lonely without me?

05:29.080 --> 05:30.130
Forgive me, 'kay?

05:32.170 --> 05:33.960
Don't sweat it.

05:33.960 --> 05:34.800
Houx-sama,

05:34.800 --> 05:36.720
you're so kind!

05:36.720 --> 05:42.640
Hey, Houx-sama, you have to take
me out on the night of April 30th.

05:42.640 --> 05:46.980
Nana's going to a party, and I'll
get lonely if I'm all by myself.

05:47.480 --> 05:49.350
Ah, that day's a no-go.

05:49.350 --> 05:53.110
We'll be accompanying Chocolat
to the Night of Walpurgis.

05:53.110 --> 05:55.960
Eh? Isn't Nana going to that party too?

05:56.400 --> 06:01.660
Yes. It's a special party for all mages
residing in the Human World.

06:01.660 --> 06:02.950
I'm going too!

06:05.080 --> 06:06.620
You certainly will not!

06:07.750 --> 06:13.040
Only those with an invitation can
enter the Night of Walpurgis.

06:13.040 --> 06:14.630
Then I'll ask Daddy.

06:14.630 --> 06:19.430
Despite your father being an
important man in the Senate,

06:19.430 --> 06:21.940
this is one case where he can't help you.

06:22.220 --> 06:24.140
No, no, noo~!

06:24.140 --> 06:26.180
I'm going to the paaarty!

06:26.770 --> 06:31.200
Too bad for you. You'll have to
play with Houx another day.

06:31.560 --> 06:33.190
I really can't go?

06:33.190 --> 06:35.570
You'll just have to bear with it.

06:35.570 --> 06:39.780
I think I'll stay with you, and just
not go to the party this year.

06:41.450 --> 06:43.460
Okay, I understand.

06:43.910 --> 06:45.990
Waffle-sama?!

06:45.990 --> 06:48.200
When did you become so mature?

06:48.200 --> 06:50.000
You've made this old woman so happy...

06:50.460 --> 06:52.970
Yep, I'm grown-up now!

06:53.380 --> 06:55.500
It's getting late, so let's go home.

06:56.420 --> 06:59.090
I never thought I'd hear
those words from you...

06:59.090 --> 07:01.480
Waffle-sama, you've become
so well-mannered.

07:02.180 --> 07:04.140
Bye for now, Houx-sama!

07:04.140 --> 07:05.980
I'll be back to play again!

07:06.720 --> 07:08.810
She's become so obedient.

07:08.810 --> 07:11.060
There must be something wrong with her.

07:11.060 --> 07:12.240
Could be...

07:18.480 --> 07:22.280
Aah, this bath feels so good!

07:25.740 --> 07:26.700
Mama...

07:27.700 --> 07:31.760
I've been invited to the Night of Walpurgis.

07:31.760 --> 07:36.380
I'm making my debut to all the
mages in the Human World.

07:37.210 --> 07:40.130
I'll do my best.

07:46.930 --> 07:48.600
I can see it now.

07:49.060 --> 07:50.720
Is that Mt. Blocken?

07:50.720 --> 07:53.230
What's wrong, Chocolat? You nervous?

07:53.230 --> 07:54.620
Trust me, I'm not!

07:55.060 --> 07:56.360
You all right?

07:56.360 --> 07:58.900
I'm fine. Let's get a move on.

08:01.610 --> 08:02.990
Wait up!

08:23.720 --> 08:25.010
She's here.

08:25.010 --> 08:27.140
Welcome, Chocolat Meilleure.

08:27.140 --> 08:28.600
The Party Hall is this way.

08:50.660 --> 08:52.660
Everyone, may I have your attention please?

08:53.200 --> 08:58.880
One of the Special Guests for this year's
Night of Walpurgis has arrived!

09:00.040 --> 09:01.600
The Queen Candidate,

09:01.600 --> 09:04.880
Chocolat Meilleure, has made her entrance!

09:08.300 --> 09:10.350
Isn't that Cinnamon's daughter?

09:10.350 --> 09:11.350
My how she's grown.

09:11.890 --> 09:14.480
Ah, what an adorable child.

09:14.480 --> 09:16.070
She's a splendid Queen Candidate.

09:16.730 --> 09:19.350
Chocolat Meilleure, would you
please introduce yourself?

09:20.190 --> 09:22.860
Are you all enjoying the party?

09:22.860 --> 09:24.920
Because if you're not, I'll whup your butt!

09:24.920 --> 09:25.540
Thanks!

09:29.070 --> 09:29.790
Chocolat?

09:30.200 --> 09:31.030
Coco?

09:31.950 --> 09:33.240
It's been ages!

09:33.240 --> 09:34.870
You were invited too?

09:34.870 --> 09:35.550
Of course.

09:36.250 --> 09:37.960
Chocolat, come this way.

09:37.960 --> 09:39.540
I'll introduce you to the others.

09:40.630 --> 09:42.290
Glad you could make it, Chocolat.

09:42.290 --> 09:43.770
I missed you, Chocolat!

09:48.470 --> 09:51.220
Chocolat's looking stronger
and brighter than usual.

09:51.220 --> 09:53.640
We can't miss our chance
to make her the Core...

09:53.640 --> 09:56.180
of the Magical World's struggle
against the Ogres.

09:56.950 --> 09:59.480
What's the latest word from
the Queen on the Ogres?

09:59.480 --> 10:01.740
She says the standoff has
become too intense...

10:01.740 --> 10:04.500
for Le Royaume to do anything about it.

10:04.900 --> 10:05.980
I suppose so.

10:05.980 --> 10:08.860
Anyway, with you and the
Palace Guards here,

10:08.860 --> 10:11.160
we shouldn't have to worry
about the party, right?

10:12.160 --> 10:13.240
Where are you going?

10:13.700 --> 10:17.080
Haven't you forgotten what I came for?

10:17.080 --> 10:18.960
Keep up the good work!

10:19.540 --> 10:20.760
Honestly...

10:37.060 --> 10:39.780
I'm not the type who gives up so easily.

10:40.190 --> 10:42.770
Don't worry about a thing, Houx-sama,
just wait for me.

10:52.160 --> 10:53.660
What is this?

10:54.910 --> 10:56.990
What's going on here?

11:27.730 --> 11:29.000
I sense a foul presence.

11:29.650 --> 11:30.480
The Ogres?

11:38.410 --> 11:41.500
That's right, yes I am...

11:41.500 --> 11:44.830
Super Star, Rockin' Robin!

11:44.830 --> 11:48.650
I'm a Glorious Star, Genius Star...

11:48.650 --> 11:55.930
Rockin' Robin Star!

11:55.930 --> 11:59.100
Star...

11:59.600 --> 12:02.390
Star...

12:09.360 --> 12:11.150
What is Robin doing?

12:11.150 --> 12:14.490
Almost all of the mages in the Human World...

12:14.490 --> 12:17.160
are here to earn ecure.

12:17.160 --> 12:18.830
I know, but still...

12:18.830 --> 12:19.800
Take a look. They're all...

12:20.540 --> 12:23.120
movie stars, actresses,

12:23.120 --> 12:25.560
musicians, best-selling authors...

12:25.960 --> 12:27.790
Celebrities, every last one of them.

12:29.290 --> 12:33.550
But I hear Rockin' Robin earns
more ecure than anyone else.

12:33.550 --> 12:36.510
Yeah, but that doesn't mean he has to
go strutting his stuff around here...

12:37.090 --> 12:40.530
But they're all from a world of show-offs,

12:40.810 --> 12:43.020
so it makes sense
that they'd wanna show off.

12:43.600 --> 12:46.270
They all remind me of Robin.

12:46.270 --> 12:47.520
If you say so...

12:47.520 --> 12:49.560
Houx-sama, we've got trouble!

12:50.610 --> 12:51.540
Tell me she's not...

12:52.230 --> 12:52.980
Who's that?

12:52.980 --> 12:53.530
That's probably...

12:55.280 --> 12:57.280
The one and only me!

12:57.280 --> 12:59.550
I decided to change myself up for the party.

12:59.950 --> 13:03.250
But that doesn't mean you have
to turn into Funny again...

13:03.250 --> 13:05.160
So? What's the "trouble"?

13:06.080 --> 13:09.330
Mercy me! Waffle-sama has disappeared!

13:10.540 --> 13:13.670
I thought she might
have come here.

13:13.670 --> 13:14.840
Haven't seen her.

13:14.840 --> 13:16.850
Besides, she shouldn't be able to get in.

13:16.850 --> 13:19.060
Indeed she shouldn't, but...

13:19.510 --> 13:22.780
Did you ask the Palace Guards to
tell you if Waffle showed up?

13:23.220 --> 13:26.230
Bravo, Houx-sama!
What a nice idea!

13:32.820 --> 13:34.790
Chocolat, let's dance, too.

13:35.240 --> 13:38.330
Eh? But I've never ever danced before.

13:38.740 --> 13:41.620
It'd be different if this were
a more flashy dance.

13:41.620 --> 13:43.330
Hey, look at those two.

13:44.040 --> 13:46.660
Don't they look great together?

13:47.460 --> 13:48.500
"Those two"?

13:50.330 --> 13:54.040
Ladies and Gentlemen,
another Special Guest has arrived!

13:56.460 --> 13:59.310
It's our other Queen Candidate,
Vanilla Mieux!

13:59.760 --> 14:00.840
Vanilla?

14:00.840 --> 14:01.640
She showed up.

14:13.060 --> 14:14.270
It really is Pierre.

14:14.900 --> 14:17.190
How could she show her face here?

14:17.190 --> 14:19.490
What could the Queen be thinking?

14:19.490 --> 14:20.660
How utterly shameful.

14:20.660 --> 14:22.240
She's an agent of the Ogres!

14:22.240 --> 14:23.570
Isn't she a traitor?

14:37.460 --> 14:38.510
My, my...

14:38.510 --> 14:39.010
What have we here?

14:44.800 --> 14:46.010
Hey, you!

14:46.720 --> 14:48.730
If you've got something to say about Vanilla,

14:48.730 --> 14:50.980
say it to her face!

15:11.120 --> 15:12.160
It's beautiful...

15:13.750 --> 15:15.750
One song, one dance?

15:24.670 --> 15:25.510
I...

15:25.970 --> 15:27.010
Follow my lead.

15:45.700 --> 15:48.120
Chocolat... can actually dance.

15:48.120 --> 15:50.620
How dare he swoop in and take Chocolat...!

15:51.160 --> 15:52.700
Chocolat looks marvelous!

15:58.460 --> 15:59.380
Thank you.

16:20.730 --> 16:21.940
What could that be?

16:21.940 --> 16:22.690
What happened?

16:22.690 --> 16:23.400
The Ogres?

16:23.400 --> 16:24.280
What is it?

16:24.280 --> 16:28.120
Something, or somebody, has broken through the barrier around Mt. Blocken.

16:29.280 --> 16:30.790
It couldn't be Waffle...

16:30.790 --> 16:33.160
Houx, Saule, what's that alarm for?

16:33.160 --> 16:35.080
Chocolat, good timing.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.000
Come with me.

16:47.260 --> 16:49.930
Pierre-sama, the barrier has been broken.

16:50.640 --> 16:51.470
I see.

16:58.650 --> 16:59.610
Commander!

16:59.610 --> 17:01.570
Something's coming from the
other side of the mountain!

17:01.570 --> 17:02.250
What?!

17:07.990 --> 17:08.950
Impossible...

17:13.080 --> 17:14.370
Nana...

17:14.370 --> 17:16.330
Waffle-sama, what happened?

17:16.330 --> 17:16.970
Waffle!

17:17.420 --> 17:18.680
Houx-sama...

17:19.210 --> 17:21.420
Nana will help you,
you poor thing...

17:21.420 --> 17:23.000
Nana, get out of the way!

17:23.000 --> 17:25.760
For once, Houx-sama's come to help me!

17:25.760 --> 17:27.300
Well, she's awfully cheerful.

17:27.300 --> 17:29.760
Just think about all the trouble
you've caused for us.

17:29.760 --> 17:33.350
I never thought I'd hear those
words from you, Chocolat.

17:34.390 --> 17:35.220
I'll whup your butt!

17:36.270 --> 17:37.740
An anti-intruder trap?

17:38.140 --> 17:39.450
Hurry up and help me.

17:40.060 --> 17:43.650
So she says, but this is Magical
World Birdlime.

17:43.650 --> 17:45.650
It's not easy to remove.

17:45.650 --> 17:46.990
What about the Palace Guards?

17:46.990 --> 17:48.700
Wouldn't they be able to take it off?

17:49.160 --> 17:51.710
Why not see if Chocolat has
anything useful first?

17:52.740 --> 17:54.290
We saw you earlier...

17:54.290 --> 17:55.970
What hole did you crawl out of?

17:56.620 --> 17:59.170
Don't worry about such minor details.

17:59.170 --> 18:00.290
So then, Chocolat...

18:00.290 --> 18:03.130
Take a good look at your items.

18:03.130 --> 18:04.750
Let's see...

18:04.750 --> 18:07.170
That's right! The Puru-Puru Oil!

18:08.550 --> 18:10.800
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:15.770 --> 18:16.280
Wand!

18:26.860 --> 18:27.190
All righty!

18:28.820 --> 18:32.660
Puru-Puru Oil, turn that birdlime to mush!

18:36.450 --> 18:38.120
Houx-sama, thank you!

18:38.660 --> 18:42.120
Hey, how'd you know I had Puru-Puru Oil?

18:42.670 --> 18:44.170
Who are you, anyway?

18:44.170 --> 18:45.960
Um, I would be...

18:46.590 --> 18:49.350
Just how did Waffle get through the barrier?

18:49.880 --> 18:52.840
This kind old man used
his powers to help me!

18:52.840 --> 18:54.430
A kind old man?

18:54.430 --> 18:54.860
Yeah!

18:55.640 --> 18:57.270
The barrier's been broken!

18:57.270 --> 18:58.890
We have an intruder!

18:58.890 --> 18:59.770
An intruder?!

19:01.980 --> 19:03.350
What was that sound?

19:03.770 --> 19:04.610
It's coming from the western gate.

19:05.650 --> 19:06.480
Go!

19:09.360 --> 19:11.030
What happened to the barrier?

19:11.030 --> 19:13.030
It's down!
Completely irreparable!

19:13.450 --> 19:14.280
What the heck?

19:14.280 --> 19:15.370
What's the meaning of this?

19:15.370 --> 19:16.280
Don't tell me they're...

19:16.280 --> 19:17.050
How did Ogres get in here?

19:18.580 --> 19:20.040
What a circus of fools.

19:20.040 --> 19:21.330
Look at all the Ogres...

19:22.580 --> 19:23.790
When did they get in?

19:23.790 --> 19:25.010
Hey, it's that guy!

19:26.090 --> 19:29.280
That man used his magic to help me get in.

19:29.740 --> 19:30.840
Juiliet!

19:30.840 --> 19:32.180
He's an Ogre!

19:32.180 --> 19:33.020
He is?

19:33.590 --> 19:36.760
I never knew something
like this would happen!

19:37.390 --> 19:39.030
Waffle-sama...

19:39.640 --> 19:41.640
Pierre-sama, it's about time.

19:41.640 --> 19:42.520
I know.

19:48.070 --> 19:49.730
The Night of Walpurgis...

19:49.730 --> 19:52.740
is a time of festivity for mages
in the Human World.

19:52.740 --> 19:55.630
And theoretically, a time
to exchange information.

19:56.530 --> 19:59.660
But we Ogres have always
been excluded from it,

19:59.660 --> 20:01.150
to the point of persecution!

20:02.080 --> 20:06.080
The first side to break promises is always that of Le Royaume.

20:06.790 --> 20:09.130
That's why I've come here
to tell you all directly...

20:10.300 --> 20:12.300
that we will take the throne,

20:12.300 --> 20:14.010
conquer the Human World,

20:14.010 --> 20:15.630
and crush Le Royaume.

20:20.510 --> 20:21.180
This is bad.

20:21.770 --> 20:22.850
What do we do?

20:22.850 --> 20:25.480
For now, let's meet up with
the Palace Guards.

20:25.480 --> 20:28.810
Why don't we listen to what they
have to say for a while longer?

20:28.810 --> 20:29.480
You're...?

20:30.570 --> 20:33.400
You couldn't be! Where've
you been all this time?

20:33.400 --> 20:35.030
That's a secret, ribbit.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.240
"Ribbit"?

20:36.240 --> 20:38.910
Oops! I can't say any more.

20:41.370 --> 20:44.680
Vanilla is a legitimate Queen Candidate recognized by Le Royaume.

20:45.290 --> 20:47.540
This Night of Walpurgis was supposed to be...

20:47.540 --> 20:49.640
the debut of the Queen Candidates.

20:50.380 --> 20:52.670
She is an excellent Queen Candidate.

20:52.670 --> 20:55.370
Just look at how many Noir she's
collected in such a short time.

20:55.720 --> 20:56.720
Noir?

20:56.720 --> 20:57.930
How dreadful!

20:57.930 --> 21:00.350
Is this the birth of an Ogre Queen?

21:00.890 --> 21:03.010
Vanilla... it can't be...

21:03.560 --> 21:06.820
This party was supposed to be fun,
but it's turned into a battle.

21:07.350 --> 21:08.810
What should I do?

21:13.690 --> 21:14.730
Stop this at once!

21:16.010 --> 21:20.030
This is the one day of the year when mages gather like this in celebration.

21:20.030 --> 21:21.990
Aren't you ashamed of yourselves?

21:21.990 --> 21:24.100
You're in the presence of Queen Candidates!

21:24.500 --> 21:25.290
Who is that?

21:25.910 --> 21:27.210
Cosmic Veil!

21:35.320 --> 21:36.420
Pretty~

21:36.420 --> 21:39.010
She has an astounding level of magical skill!

21:47.520 --> 21:48.270
Chocolat?

21:48.890 --> 21:50.980
The mood changed instantly.

21:52.070 --> 21:54.490
All the conflict's been absorbed by the stars.

21:55.200 --> 21:57.070
This is some intense magic.

21:57.700 --> 21:59.780
Who could she be?

22:01.210 --> 22:02.160
Umm...

22:06.350 --> 22:09.870
Am I just imagining this familiar scent?

22:23.610 --> 22:26.110
That girl is good and this girl is good too

22:26.110 --> 22:27.760
It's so very hard to choose

22:28.780 --> 22:31.450
That guy is bad and this guy is bad

22:31.450 --> 22:33.000
Jealousy will drive them mad

22:36.710 --> 22:39.370
Dresses are nice, ribbons are nice too

22:39.370 --> 22:40.960
Blue jeans just won't do!

22:42.040 --> 22:44.670
How about a kiss, what about tomorrow?

22:44.670 --> 22:46.380
"I will not let you go home"

22:50.390 --> 22:52.550
Why is it that all boys

22:52.550 --> 22:54.550
are always the same

22:54.550 --> 22:58.350
and drive me up the wall?

22:58.350 --> 23:02.020
I don't get them at all

23:08.700 --> 23:11.360
Making big plans and going on dates

23:11.360 --> 23:13.040
from one town to the next

23:13.990 --> 23:16.750
Sitting on swingsets, staying up real late

23:16.750 --> 23:18.410
having our little chats

23:22.080 --> 23:24.710
Whispering voices, in between the bedsheets

23:24.710 --> 23:26.340
Little kisses are so sweet

23:27.390 --> 23:30.050
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:30.050 --> 23:31.510
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:32.680 --> 23:35.260
Somebody kill the lights in the room, cause

23:35.260 --> 23:37.060
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:38.060 --> 23:39.810
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:40.730 --> 23:42.400
Mama's gonna wake up soon

23:48.330 --> 23:50.270
I thought the party would be fun.

23:51.440 --> 23:53.620
But the Night of Walpurgis became...

23:54.420 --> 23:58.200
...a battleground between the Ogres and Le Royaume.

23:58.200 --> 23:59.510
I hate this!

23:59.950 --> 24:03.630
Pierre, Vanilla,
don't fight us any more!

24:04.900 --> 24:07.330
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:07.330 --> 24:09.330
Message from Mama.

24:10.300 --> 24:13.290
I'll use all my magic to protect Vanilla!
